      "text": "get /event?searchtext=__&location=__&date=__ --> event[] \n\nget /seat?eventid=eid --> available seats[]\n\npost /book --> ticket_id (payment will be handaled internally the \n                                      user will be redirected to payment page after some checks\n                                      once it is done will attach the payment details and book \n                                      the seat )\nReq Body: {\n            eventid=eid;\n            seatid=sid;\n          }",
