      "seed": 880982412,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790484476390,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "-> when a booking comes we will set a redis key with nx ex 5 mins for that\n   eventid_seatid:\"booking\" -> k:v pair, that way only one ticket can be booked \n   for one seat.\n\n-> when a key in redis expires we will subscribe to that key and one expiry we \n   will update the db also that the seat is available if not booked. we will keep \n   our transctions less, by updating redis along with our db early if the seat is booked. ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> when a booking comes we will set a redis key with nx ex 5 mins for that\n   eventid_seatid:\"booking\" -> k:v pair, that way only one ticket can be booked \n   for one seat.\n\n-> when a key in redis expires we will subscribe to that key and one expiry we \n   will update the db also that the seat is available if not booked. we will keep \n   our transctions less, by updating redis along with our db early if the seat is booked. ",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 163
    },
